{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11114130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11114130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111413001:0":{"text":"블랙골드 상회의 물건 같아. ","source_cn":"像是黑金商会的东西，","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387C307BFB9B40FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111413002:0":{"text":"자기를 대신해 일할 사람들을 잡아갔지만, 결국 거미의 독니에서 벗어나지는 못했네.","source_cn":"虽然抓了一群人替自己干活，但还是有些倒霉的家伙，最终没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11E82954B072CBFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111413003:0":{"text":"그러고 보니 사막의 발톱도 블랙골드 상회에 된통 당한 거 같네요.","source_cn":"这么说来，流沙之爪也被黑金商会摆了一道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61CB1A3CDECF2517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111413004:0":{"text":"프랭크는 그들이 거미 소굴을 피하려고 땅굴을 파고 있다는 건 꿈에도 몰랐을 거예요. 아마 그냥 보물을 찾는 거라고 생각했겠죠.","source_cn":"弗兰克还以为要挖宝藏，没想到只是为了绕开蜘蛛巢穴而挖地道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E349840D6F9F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111413005:0":{"text":"처음으로 그의 죽음이 안타깝다는 생각을 했어.","source_cn":"我第一次为他的死而遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80386CEBA395FE58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111413006:0":{"text":"네? 왜요?","source_cn":"啊？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5804CF7E4BD039","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111413007:0":{"text":"처음 거미 알을 파냈을 때 어떤 표정을 지을지 궁금해서.","source_cn":"我很好奇他挖出一堆蜘蛛卵时，脸上是什么表情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED52EE4FE19737EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111413008:0":{"text":"음... 그렇게 말하니까, 해미도 조금 궁금해지긴 하네요.","source_cn":"嗯……你这么一说，我也有点好奇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6BED1D8084F9FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}